### health, which a gateway probes
# expect 200
GET {{base}}/health

### the preflight a gateway often answers itself
# expect 204
OPTIONS {{base}}/tasks
Origin: https://course.example
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET

### the route behind the gateway
# expect 200
GET {{base}}/tasks?limit=2

### and the counters it exposes
# expect 200
GET {{base}}/metrics
